      <Placemark>
        <name>Jericho (יריחו)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<h3>Jericho (יריחו)</h3>
<p><b>Period:</b> 02. Pre-Pottery Neolithic (PPN) (-8300 to -5500 BCE)</p>
<p><b>Installation Type:</b> Spring Cave Capture</p>
<p><b>Location Precision:</b> Tier 1: High Precision (Pinpoint Well/Installation &lt; 50m)</p>
<p><b>Region:</b> Jordan Valley</p>
<p><b>Dissertation Reference:</b> §2.2 (Pages 46)</p>
<hr/>
<p><b>Archaeological Description (02. Pre-Pottery Neolithic):</b></p>
<p>A settlement from the Pre-Pottery Neolithic A period, located near the Elisha Spring in the Jordan Valley.</p>]]></description>
