      <name>06. Middle Bronze Age (MB) (-2200 to -1550 BCE)</name>
      <description>תקופת הברונזה התיכונה (MB I-II) - 16 sites</description>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Bozrah (Busra) (בוצרה (סוריה))</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<h3>Bozrah (Busra) (בוצרה (סוריה))</h3>
<p><b>Period:</b> 06. Middle Bronze Age (MB) (-2200 to -1550 BCE)</p>
<p><b>Installation Type:</b> Deep Well</p>
<p><b>Location Precision:</b> Tier 4: International Comparative Site (&lt; 100m - 1km)</p>
<p><b>Region:</b> Syria</p>
<p><b>Dissertation Reference:</b> §2.6.13 (Pages 89)</p>
<hr/>
<p><b>Archaeological Description (06. Middle Bronze Age):</b></p>
<p>A well in the northern part of the tel, dated to the Middle Bronze Age, which was abandoned along with a house and garden it supplied with water.</p>]]></description>
