          <Data name="Dissertation_Pages"><value>75</value></Data>
          <Data name="Description"><value>During the Middle Bronze Age, the city of Jericho was fortified, and Elisha&apos;s Spring (Ein es-Sultan) was intentionally included within its city walls to provide a secure water source.</value></Data>
