      <Placemark>
        <name>Ai (et-Tell) (העי (א-תל))</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<h3>Ai (et-Tell) (העי (א-תל))</h3>
<p><b>Period:</b> 09. Iron Age II (-1000 to -586 BCE)</p>
<p><b>Installation Type:</b> Plastered Cistern</p>
<p><b>Location Precision:</b> Tier 1: High Precision (Pinpoint Well/Installation &lt; 50m)</p>
<p><b>Region:</b> Judean Hills</p>
<p><b>Dissertation Reference:</b> § (Pages 191)</p>
<hr/>
<p><b>Archaeological Description (09. Iron Age II):</b></p>
<p>Cisterns or pools were found at Ai (et-Tell), dated to the Iron Age II period.</p>]]></description>
